body:
Reproduced with:
```
curl -HContent-Type:application/json -uelastic:password -XPOST localhost:9200/test/_doc?refresh -d'{"foo": "foo"}'
curl -HContent-Type:application/json -uelastic:password -XPUT localhost:9200/_cluster/settings -d'{
  "transient": {
    "logger.org.elasticsearch.xpack.esql.plugin": "DEBUG"
  }
}'

curl -HContent-Type:application/json -uelastic:password -XPOST localhost:9200/_query -d'{
  "query": "FROM test METADATA _index | EVAL cluster=MV_FIRST(SPLIT(_index, \":\")) | WHERE CASE(cluster == \"remote1\", true, false)"
}'
```

Fix is easy enough. I'll remove the `ThrowingDriverContext` entirely.
